    "body": "Right now the Equivalent Domains is sent from the client and stored on the server in plain text. This should be encrypted on the client the same as passwords/sites.\r\n\r\nThis isn't a huge security issue, but if the database was compromised then the list of domains would be available from each account. This list of domains would be ones that the user has accounts on creating a privacy issue.",
